{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "1fee5cde76a40d99352e760155f275a4468edbd68690befb4b45f64780ae29ab", "ja": "優雅な姫が語るには！なのです", "zh": "优雅公主的说法喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5ce1388fcd3d31f806c29c03248ee24526f6123e41a9197655c7b8dbc89a1c6d", "ja": "『お姫様講座』第2回講師は貴音。普段通り\n優雅に仕事をこなす貴音に、エミリーは憧れ\nの視線を向けるが、貴音からは「今日の自分\nではなく、デュオを組む『ふたりらしさ』を\n大事にしてほしい」と教えられる。", "zh": "『公主讲座』第二堂课的讲师是贵音，\n艾蜜莉对总是优雅完成工作的贵音\n投以憧憬的目光，但贵音告诉她们\n「真正该重视的不是今天的自己，\n而是双人组的『自我风格』」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f64b0eeb7aa5dfa5c862574f2e90a12e44e760a4528380350d51b0e08352cdd", "ja": "（今日は『お姫様講座』の第2回という事だが……\n今度は一体、どんな内容なんだろうな）", "zh": "（今天是第二堂『公主讲座』……\n这次究竟会是什么样的内容呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "bdb5e4d99831a571ed9c27eb71f4d8b54bbc3317c43c1fb0d7a989a31a823cd0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、エミリーちゃん、\nお待ちかねなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生、小艾蜜莉，\n你们都等不及了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "cf1587738d15fd77e42914b94dd285d06c78cd62e990e965798da41ad05982b6", "ja": "『お姫様講座』第2回、はじまりはじまりなのです～！\nいぇ～い！なのです！", "zh": "第二堂『公主讲座』要开始了喔～！\n耶～的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8dc6f8e6ca591135b5d311dddd374a2e2732df5e85aa4b7a200f635c66ce9d06", "ja": "い、イェーイ！", "zh": "耶、耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "9d8239f30cf620887669598e58ffc464749d00f5fa69db5d88049479ff6a03e8", "ja": "ど、どんどん、ぱふぱふ～……です！", "zh": "咚、咚咚，叭噗叭噗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "c1f32db7f06fd78bfbfdced155f44956f6a07af8a01f33b6716aa0ec6af4906b", "ja": "ではさっそく、講師の先生をお呼びするのです。\n今回の先生は……こちらの方なのです！", "zh": "那我们赶紧请主讲老师出来的喔，\n这次的老师是……这一位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "b8641d642275da6ca4b2cc8c2aa669fabfc7c084105a40bed6767976bade4193", "ja": "まつり姫の呼びかけに応じて、参上いたしました。\n四条貴音です。", "zh": "小女子四条贵音，\n今日应茉莉公主的要求而来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "841bb27cfbf2dba60ee4bb55eb729528352c57c328587e9389d38b17e6eb7274", "ja": "まあ！？\nまつりさん、貴音さまが先生なのですか！？", "zh": "哇！？\n茉莉，老师是贵音小姐吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "7136b060c1e9d0a584f9b42568e12bf0b3421608824d19cd5ae25f826fc4dbff", "ja": "姫といえば、まつり姫。\nそして、貴音姫なのです。", "zh": "说到公主，第一个想到的就是茉莉公主，\n以及贵音公主的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "01a6da1738aa1344e0a0b9189ed694d31541d087bf50cb6bd1de5842bd5c4645", "ja": "ですが、あの……まつり姫。先生といっても、\n私はいったい、何をすればよいのでしょうか？", "zh": "但是，那个……茉莉公主，你说老师，\n小女子究竟该做什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "34f469bfb623f80c209711ff995c083faed0f02f60729d4e0c69a0ac107b8902", "ja": "私とて、まだまだ未熟な身。\n人様に何かを教えられるほどでは……。", "zh": "小女子仍不成熟，\n尚未到达能够教授他人的境界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "281ddc4596ac95039b44565cd256b211637f924e9423fbc8aee8999f9d3d202b", "ja": "いいえ、そんなことはありません！　貴音さまの\n立ち居振る舞いを拝見するだけでも、勉強になります！", "zh": "不，没这回事！\n光是拜见贵音小姐的言行举止，就是一种学习了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "05375d5eac272b0fc18f285929bf756440fbe79936289896f63025d32c9ea518", "ja": "そのとおりなのです、貴音姫。\nただそばにいるだけでも、学べることは多いのですよ。", "zh": "她说得没错的喔，贵音公主。\n只要在你身边，就能学习到很多东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5e8007d31e3f2dbf3c8702492ca84ac4f46cca2061a80dc4fa828c38bf301d9d", "ja": "なるほど、貴音から何かを教わるんじゃなくて、\n自主的に学び取ろうという訳か……。", "zh": "原来如此，不是要让贵音教些什么，\n而是自主学习吸收啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "d0f8d69dafa71891e8d60186dba80ff6f5a3293f78b45721306b4e0f09b14680", "ja": "そういうことなのです！　というわけで……\n今日は1日、貴音姫に密着取材なのです～！", "zh": "就是这样的喔！所以……\n今天一整天，我们要贴身采访贵音公主的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "8e92d3bd621dde479793f46f28d3193afba2fa32d8b59618060a6e09172e14bd", "ja": "なんと……そういうことでしたか。わかりました。\nでは、どうぞ如何様にも、ご自由に。", "zh": "没想到……原来是这样，小女子明白了。\n那么就请各位自便了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "4daa2e05b821ff6ea8c1f5f30ad4c9488e3e6e6dd127a40e7d9d133002751c5b", "ja": "はいほー！\n貴音姫、よろしくお願いするのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho～！\n贵音公主，请多指教的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "11cb5f61406cf9150cfd7f7c7fa098105d4d0f26a841a365da2681af3159add3", "ja": "よ、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "请、请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "38189b0cee6358db84cefc871486fe64222bf1d74e069ae31e49f01a6bc07707", "ja": "貴音が許可してくれたとはいえ、ふたりとも、\nあまり邪魔にならないようにしような！", "zh": "就算贵音同意了，\n你们也别过度打扰她喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053", "ja": "はいなのです！", "zh": "好的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "41801a5328984c3d7115ecdd9cacdb2d96cfe6339a1e4aa8bbd48e1ed0eb45d5", "ja": "いち、に、さん、し……。\nご、ろく、しち、はち……。", "zh": "一、二、三、四……\n五、六、七、八……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "5165e03e94dff55c446f73df4891a645708b14b5bf7f23f85aa64acaa3556227", "ja": "はう～！　舞のお稽古をなさっている貴音さま……\nなんてお美しいのでしょう……♪", "zh": "哇呜～！练习舞蹈的贵音小姐……\n实在是太美丽了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "82d9404861d55226590725d418f44b33210810ef790549089265ac3f0620587d", "ja": "うん……、普通のレッスン風景だけどな！", "zh": "嗯……其实只是普通的训练而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "e4e86f2c0a958372b610b4b3db89bf75da270fd2cdae107d24d4c79f3d51987a", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、あまり近づくとお邪魔なのです。\n姫と一緒に、すこし離れて見ていましょー。", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，靠得太近会打扰到她的喔，\n和公主一起保持距离观赏吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "7a4963c5af71f3dc5336b0e89d9b1fd5e718b58c58cf35331b8f7192e08d9b7e", "ja": "はい、まつりさん！\nはぁ……貴音さまの舞う姿……♪", "zh": "是的，茉莉！\n哇……贵音小姐的舞姿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e2e9b812b4ae2bc3dd9b05b86ba972aa9de110e62b71193a800ccb93fdd94568", "ja": "そして、貴音がゲストのラジオ収録も見学か……。\n本当に密着取材だな。", "zh": "连贵音担任来宾的广播录音也要观摩啊……\n真的是贴身采访呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "f212ebc7e8c850a3e671a26e68a848c4a3da5519194f63533b4cd76ea81304d2", "ja": "皆様、本日はよろしくお願いいたします。\n差し入れのさぶれです。どうぞ召し上がってください。", "zh": "今天请各位多多指教。\n小女子带了法式酥饼来慰劳各位，敬请享用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1027_staff", "source_sha256": "f49cca216a8f6292c7cb77f46adb0c8de5ec785a1141115dc03f82bcba7c68d0", "ja": "四条さん、ありがとうございまーす！\nいただきまーす！", "zh": "四条小姐，谢谢你～！\n我开动了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "7037e8ad0efd3e34cad4f896f8ba57704d3d4427473d9382c29363dfd14fb606", "ja": "なんという細やかな気配り……。\nあの姿こそ、私の憧れた大和撫子そのものです……！", "zh": "如此细腻体贴……\n这模样正是我所向往的大和抚子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "2d9bc0075ce2d0c66e1e69025bf5d89aefb1f08c10636ef7a74403950e2cf2ad", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、エミリーちゃん。\n声が入ってしまうので、もうちょっと抑えましょー。", "zh": "小艾蜜莉、小艾蜜莉，\n声音会被录进去的，小声一点吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "0d246f9d065687e348348e4156f4d5dc06d4177d96ba2afca8bb45317abfcacd", "ja": "はうっ、申し訳ありません……！", "zh": "啊呜，非常抱歉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "6e1452b4629bcb2b3fb4062c8798eb36ded2a0205f70ad89541aeef3dcfdfeb5", "ja": "かっぷらーめんは、お湯の量が肝心なのです。\nかっぷの内側に書かれている線の、下に合わせて……。", "zh": "泡面的重点在于热水的量，\n要对准画在容器内侧的线下方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1032_se", "source_sha256": "0747c206910ca304c47aad51cdf117a2e57ab71753bfd3e3e8881025e7f22639", "ja": "コポコポコポ……", "zh": "咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "75af583d38322c9dd8853a56b6a0357cdee462d75f80e8d49490e4b5dc4b7b01", "ja": "Wow！　容器入即席麺にお湯を注ぐお姿……\nなんと、真剣なお顔なのでしょう……！", "zh": "Wow！把热水倒进附容器速食面的模样……\n表情是如此认真……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8b2cb58d19507febb5c5cfeaa6d5149e65f3dda2422aaf09efe74c7ad605ee7d", "ja": "エミリー……。\nなんだか、亜利沙みたいになってきてるな……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉……\n总觉得她变得跟亚利沙好像啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "6d42e9c9f6146d8433497d3cd311e04fee273d53a7e687a8981c22d198766f39", "ja": "まつりも、そう思っていたところなのです……。", "zh": "茉莉也这么想的喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "9f158278578a7a549afb815ef89b74e498ed034addfe86b59aea4500efe7c083", "ja": "エミリー、まつり姫。本日は真、お疲れさまでした。\n何か、得られるものはありましたか？", "zh": "艾蜜莉、茉莉公主，今日着实辛苦两位了。\n两位有什么收获吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "54aac51ebc7c9b0ad189c985144fc0747132cd8db4214cb3d5a0fd4be2239b2f", "ja": "はい！　大和撫子がどのようなものか、\nとてもよくわかった気がします！", "zh": "有的！我似乎对何谓大和抚子\n有了更深的了解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "b19a66d13b777e1615f9de3c65221470039c8c336b36b9dfa258035ed3fbd937", "ja": "貴音姫、ありがとうなのです。\nとっても、ぶらぼー！な講座だったのです。", "zh": "贵音公主，感谢你的喔，\n真是非常棒的讲座喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6e82294a41c86723b0a94e4ea0cb8297a02c80c8129674e8eabc6fb47c5d1091", "ja": "貴音。よかったら最後に、ふたりに何か\nアドバイスしてあげてくれないか？", "zh": "贵音，\n你能不能在最后给她们一点建议呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1040_008tak", "source_sha256": "d947dc9b87be91d82672ced9170115135420087a65ad1782a6a191c1563296cf", "ja": "あどばいす、ですか？\n……わかりました。それでは、ひとつだけ……。", "zh": "建议吗？\n……了解，那有一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1041_008tak", "source_sha256": "4389b691b27ad9927066c7a3f0a5916bffdd7eee8f9442fb8d9199a407cc1c92", "ja": "二人とも。今日の私の振る舞いには、\nどうか囚われないでください。", "zh": "请两位不要被\n小女子今日的举止所局限。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "41508a835962ff3816b0b3769f472dbd7fed26c4eaf47e5da6a61910da91ff04", "ja": "えっ！？　貴音さま、それは何故ですか？\nせっかく教わったのに……。", "zh": "咦！？贵音小姐，这是为什么呢？\n难得学到了这么多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1043_008tak", "source_sha256": "103b4ffba9e7d82ac844ca9ad747a7ab11730fa57f980805ded45c4162b20929", "ja": "でゅおを組むのは私ではなく、まつり姫とエミリー。\n二人なのですから。", "zh": "因为要组成双人组的不是小女子，\n而是茉莉公主和艾蜜莉你们两位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "07f293d60f2e36543a24eb1b30aaf77f5239dde178646a99fc3af3a10acb4228", "ja": "他にはない、二人らしい……\nそんなゆにっとを、目指してくださいね。", "zh": "不模仿别人，走出你们自己的风格……\n请努力成为这样的团体吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "2e290445f2b7c0ac8aaa2dbba218ec615ca66e253a2208747065be095c37a342", "ja": "私とまつりさんらしい、二人組……！\nは、はいっ、わかりました！", "zh": "有我和茉莉风格的两人团体……！\n好、好的，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "a04f53ebe7825884c0741bb4fafaa82e6859bab2ec7d1e24995d55631065fc67", "ja": "貴音姫、ありがとうなのです！\n第2回お姫様講座は、無事終了なのですー！", "zh": "贵音公主，谢谢你的喔！\n第二堂『公主讲座』顺利结束了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "e4edd89e4915a9eff3297953b330711217a7fe83923ce1df20b0c956763b4db0", "ja": "（この調子なら、貴音の気持ちにも応えてくれる\nだろう。ふたりらしいお姫様、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（继续这样努力下去，应该能够回应贵音的用心吧，\n真期待有两人风格的公主呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
